%N A394956 Numerators of the likelihoods of the n-cocktail party graphs (equivalently, the n-ladder rung graphs).
%C A394956 The n-cocktail party graph K_(n X 2) is the complement of the n-ladder rung graph nP_2, and graph likelihood is invariant under complementation.
%H A394956 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/CocktailPartyGraph.html">Cocktail Party Graph</a>.
%H A394956 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/GraphLikelihood.html">Graph Likelihood</a>.
%H A394956 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/LadderRungGraph.html">Ladder Rung Graph</a>.
%F A394956 a(n) = numerator([z^(2*n)] InverseErf(sqrt(2/Pi)*z)^2/(2*n - 1)!).
%t A394956 Table[Numerator[Together[SeriesCoefficient[InverseErf[Sqrt[2/Pi] z]^2, {z, 0, 2 n}]/(2 n - 1)!]], {n, 20}]
%Y A394956 Denominators are in A397599.
%K A394956 nonn,frac
%O A394956 1,3
%A A394956 _Eric W. Weisstein_, Jul 31 2026
